            "review_title": "Review at Le Loi",
            "review_text": "Freyja B\n5 contributions\n1\nA must-visit for a unique coffee experience.\nAug 2023 • Solo\nMy visit to L’Usine Le Loi in Saigon was a delightful escape into a charming and creative café. The café’s industrial-chic design and artistic ambiance provided a perfect setting to enjoy a cup of coffee. The menu featured a variety of gourmet coffees and delectable pastries, each a treat for the senses. Whether you’re looking for a cozy spot to work or a place to catch up with friends, L’Usine Le Loi offers a welcoming and inspiring atmosphere. The staff’s friendly service added to the overall enjoyment. This café is a must-visit for those seeking a unique and creative coffee experience in Saigon.\nRead more\nWritten September 21, 2023",
