            "review_text": "omega132857\nChichester, United Kingdom2230 contributions\n0\nNice area for a stroll\nMar 2020\nOur guide took us here for a nice afternoon stroll. There are plenty of shops to look at, and also plenty of food places to eat, which we checked out later. Our guide took us to a street to meet a local street artisan who specialises in traditional engravings. WE are now the proud owners of a carved pen, with our names on them. Our guide even paid for them, that was nice of him.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 14, 2020",
