            "review_text": "adrianyong\nSingapore, Singapore1501 contributions\n0\nStreets of excitement - Le Loi and Nguyen Hue\nDec 2015 • Family\nTake a casual evening stroll along Le Loi and Nguyen Hue Streets and you would be pleasantly surprised by the energy and variety of local made products from famous painters to quality lacquer goods that never fail to excite foreigners.\nThe street shop vendors are friendly and will engage you in their own topic of passion and are so willing to share a tip or two with you.\nThe streets are literally coloured up by the display of their crafts and really is a photographer's paradise.\nNever return to your Hotel without checking out these two streets of wonder.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 15, 2016",
